# Docker build-context filter.
# The repo is developed on an exFAT volume that drops AppleDouble `._*` sidecars;
# their xattrs make Docker's context sender fail, so exclude them before it
# stats/xattrs them.
._*
**/._*
node_modules
**/node_modules
.git
.turbo
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/dist
careeros-screens
*.log
# local self-signed TLS material must never enter a build context
infra/nginx/certs
*.key
*.pem
